(7019532, 1063808, 54446, '<td valign="top">I''d be interested in knowing if you used water.  It looks like the surface tension of h2o.  Vodka might have taken on some different light bending characteristics.  I love the refracted lines.  I think this might have been even better without the few extraneous reflections.</td>', 'I''d be interested in knowing if you used water.  It looks like the surface tension of h2o.  Vodka might have taken on some different light bending characteristics.  I love the refracted lines.  I think this might have been even better without the few extraneous reflections.', '2013-04-13 14:10:51.000000', NULL, 1),
