(7019534, 1063464, 54446, '<td valign="top">Lots of colors.  Good refractions through the water droplets of varying sizes and shape.  Good use of surface tension.</td>', 'Lots of colors.  Good refractions through the water droplets of varying sizes and shape.  Good use of surface tension.', '2013-04-13 14:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
