(7019584, 1064023, 54446, '<td valign="top">There are definitely refracted lines and shapes.  The image would fare better in the challenge if it were not so small.</td>', 'There are definitely refracted lines and shapes.  The image would fare better in the challenge if it were not so small.', '2013-04-13 15:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
