(7021635, 1063974, 124982, '<td valign="top">Oh my, this is quite beautiful! So much more power and impact than the contrived studio shots. Wonderfully captured! Second in show for me! Bravo!</td>', 'Oh my, this is quite beautiful! So much more power and impact than the contrived studio shots. Wonderfully captured! Second in show for me! Bravo!', '2013-04-16 20:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
