(7023094, 1063918, 147861, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all of the kind words and comments.  They are really appreciated.  I am so excited about the results from this competition.  After the initial scores, I was just hoping that my score would stay above 7, since my previous high was in the 6.3 range.  I am thrilled to have received a ribbon.  With my first year in DPChallenge ending April 27, I am looking forward to continuing to grow as a photographer in my second year.</td>', 'Thanks for all of the kind words and comments.  They are really appreciated.  I am so excited about the results from this competition.  After the initial scores, I was just hoping that my score would stay above 7, since my previous high was in the 6.3 range.  I am thrilled to have received a ribbon.  With my first year in DPChallenge ending April 27, I am looking forward to continuing to grow as a photographer in my second year.', '2013-04-19 01:58:47.000000', NULL, 0),
