(7023175, 1063808, 135744, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by h2:</b></div><hr/><i> A classic. Lacks a bit of contrast and might have worked better from a lower angle </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks h2 - I did try a lower angle but think I choose the higher angle to be able to see the swirls in the water looking down.<br/> <br/>Here is a straight out of the camera lower angle shot - just grabbed this quickly from the many shots in the folder so may not be the best of this viewpoint<br/> <br/><a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=1065459" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img alt="'' . substr(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1065459.jpg'', strrpos(''//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1065459.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//images.dpchallenge.com/images_portfolio/135000-139999/135744/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_1065459.jpg"/></a></td>', 'Originally posted by h2: A classic. Lacks a bit of contrast and might have worked better from a lower angle   Thanks h2 - I did try a lower angle but think I choose the higher angle to be able to see the swirls in the water looking down. Here is a straight out of the camera lower angle shot - just grabbed this quickly from the many shots in the folder so may not be the best of this viewpoint ', '2013-04-19 08:14:53.000000', NULL, 0),
