(7231321, 1063464, 117534, '<td valign="top">WOW I had to come snoop at your work after your win ... Dude You are Awesome at this style!! I mean REALLY AWESOME!!! Again I say you need a portfolio of these style shots and sell them on FAA...   Are you using prime lenses on these? forgive me I am totally unfamiliar with Tamron''s  Di II LD  abbreviations looked like it may be an auto focus 60mm prime??   How close will that lens get into things?   You is giving me goosey bumps with these types of work.... AND  normally my taste does not run to this style, so the fact I can''t take my eyes away is like WAYYYYYY BIGGGGG Compliment!!!!     Nothing but Luv for ya darlin'' (ok did that sound cool or like a geek) LOL</td>', 'WOW I had to come snoop at your work after your win ... Dude You are Awesome at this style!! I mean REALLY AWESOME!!! Again I say you need a portfolio of these style shots and sell them on FAA...   Are you using prime lenses on these? forgive me I am totally unfamiliar with Tamron''s  Di II LD  abbreviations looked like it may be an auto focus 60mm prime??   How close will that lens get into things?   You is giving me goosey bumps with these types of work.... AND  normally my taste does not run to this style, so the fact I can''t take my eyes away is like WAYYYYYY BIGGGGG Compliment!!!!     Nothing but Luv for ya darlin'' (ok did that sound cool or like a geek) LOL', '2014-06-20 12:30:25.000000', NULL, 0),
